  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add garlic and Thai chilies and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add shredded cabbage and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add fish sauce, lime juice, and salt, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in cooked rice and cook for 2 minutes, breaking up any clumps with a spatula.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving platter and garnish with chopped scallions."
